OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to choose right NHS service
OL,4,Aas demand grows
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to choose the
OL,7,FNHS service that best matches their
OL,8,Fneeds as hospitals prepare for
OL,9,Fincreased pressure on emergency care
OL,10,Fover the winter.
OL,12,FNHS Surrey and Sussex has issued an
OL,13,Fautumn alert and urged people to know
OL,14,Fwhere services are available and how
OL,15,Fthey can get help as the school
OL,16,Fholidays approach.
OL,18,FHealth chiefs said demand on emergency
OL,19,Fdepartments remained high, with last
OL,20,Fmonth the busiest September on record
OL,21,Ffor A&E services in England, with 2.44
OL,22,Fmillion visits.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
