OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to choose right NHS service
OL,4,Aas demand grows
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessor Andrew Rhodes said people
OL,7,Fshould still use A&E or call 999 in a
OL,8,Fserious or life-threatening emergency,
OL,9,Fbut urged residents to consider other
OL,10,Fservices where appropriate.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
